Plonky3
    https://github.com/Plonky3/Plonky3
    Copyright the Plonky3 contributors
    Licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0

    budzero/bud-proof/src/bud_stark/ is derived from the `p3-uni-stark` crate.
    It is a fork with local modifications, not an independent implementation:
    the module layout matches upstream and roughly two thirds of the prover and
    verifier lines are shared with p3-uni-stark 0.6.2. Local changes are
    concentrated in constraint folding for the Budlum VM AIR and in the proof
    and config types.

